		{"id":"e88a491de477536b","type":"text","text":"Cling Complex: Looking for a muse or a savior who can handle their emotional world","x":130,"y":1100,"width":250,"height":700},
		{"id":"8a01acfae691e4d7","type":"text","text":"High Logic, control, and execution, but completely detached from emotional depth. Rigid, mechanical machine trapped in the Psychological Defenses","x":444,"y":1100,"width":250,"height":700},
		{"id":"d4e1c1754e3ff9db","type":"text","text":"Mentor Complex (Searching for a hero to provide them with authority and direction)","x":-2025,"y":1100,"width":305,"height":700},
		{"id":"ddd6b3c867797172","type":"text","text":"Hyper-critical","x":-1665,"y":1100,"width":250,"height":77},
		{"id":"a0294197267dea5d","type":"text","text":"Opinionated","x":-1365,"y":1100,"width":250,"height":77},
		{"id":"962d928404e253bc","type":"text","text":"High emotional awareness and intuition, zero execution, structure, or discipline. Feel deeply, but Agent never acts.","x":-2360,"y":1100,"width":305,"height":700},
		{"id":"1a4dc21fa7becef2","type":"text","text":"Witness observes both poles, using Anima to listen, feel, sense truth; animus side (logic + agent) to structure, defend, execute truth in reality","x":-960,"y":1360,"width":250,"height":77},
		{"id":"3814d0d9f2ef5e77","type":"text","text":"Projection onto others","x":-413,"y":837,"width":250,"height":157},
